@set title text=**Ideas with**
**a pulse.**
@set subtitle text=A warm, cinematic system for launches, creative work, and stories people should feel.

@popslide ember_content transition=slide-left duration=0.45
@set title text=**Build the emotional arc.**
@set subtitle text=Contrast gives every beat its own temperature while the system keeps it coherent.
@set card_one_title text=**Tension**
@set card_one_body text=Show the gap between what is and what could be.
@set card_two_title text=**Turn**
@set card_two_body text=Reveal the insight that changes how the room sees the problem.
@set card_three_title text=**Release**
@set card_three_body text=Give the audience a clear and satisfying next move.
